    },
    {
      "question": "When using this card's [Activate: Main] effect to give one of my opponent's rested DON!! cards to their Leader or one of their Characters, which player decides which DON!! card is given?",
      "answer": "The player who activated the effect chooses a rested DON!! card from their opponent's cost area.",
